<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 320 million.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 320 million.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction June 17 versus June 10  SUVK :</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   210/186		361/337</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.18/3.12	     3.42/3.28</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.20/3.12	     3.42/3.28</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.17/3.10	     3.42/3.27</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   220/787		100/40</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    270/987		450/40</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 43,334 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
